## >>chng 26 nov 04, from 10.42 to 10.38, initial update of the monitors
monitor column density "H2O+"      10.38  
monitor column density "H2O"       14.048  
monitor column density "H3O+"      11.412  
monitor column density "HCl+"      11.288  
