monitor column density "NS+"       11.19  
monitor column density "NS"        14.14
monitor column density "OCN"       9.509  
monitor column density "OCS"       11.07  
## >>chng 26 nov 04, from 10.33 to 10.26, initial update of the monitors
monitor column density "OH+"       10.26  
monitor column density "OHgrn"     14.87  
monitor column density "SiH"       12.23  
monitor column density "SiH2+"     10.187  
monitor column density "SiN+"      12.61  
